You can only poison a very few weapons by dipping them in potions of
sickness.  But the ones you can dip are the kind you usually get in
bunches -- darts, arrows, etc.  I'm not sure what extra damage it does,
but often you'll get the message "the poison was deadly" when the
monster dies, so I presume it takes strength away and maybe reduces max
HP for monsters that regenerate (just a guess).

